---
source: tests/proxy_golden.rs
description: "A structured-output call (responseMimeType application/json with responseJsonSchema, as Gemini CLI's utility calls send) adds a JSON-only instruction with the schema to the system prompt; thinkingBudget 0 disables thinking."
---
{
  "model": "claude-haiku-4-5",
  "system": "Decide who speaks next.\n\nRespond with a single valid JSON value only: no prose, no explanations and no Markdown code fences. The JSON must conform to this JSON Schema: {\"properties\":{\"next_speaker\":{\"enum\":[\"user\",\"model\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"reasoning\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"reasoning\",\"next_speaker\"],\"type\":\"object\"}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Analyze the last turn"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "thinking": {
    "type": "disabled"
  },
  "max_tokens": 8192,
  "temperature": 0
}
